{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0f05579f157c52b160441f1592d7ca5c9467afb9ae832e1fe8f5853478465ec2", "ja": "（亜美がミリオンパークのイベントにゲスト出演した。\nうん、問題なくこなしてくれたな！）", "zh": "（亚美作为嘉宾出演了百万乐园的活动。\n嗯，她顺利完成了，没出什么问题！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "db5277944e585a72cafdda29557a663da327b8f633029e8beb63bb65c1d8ec44", "ja": "兄ちゃん！　ちゃんと楽しんでる～？\nせっかくのミリオンパークだよ！", "zh": "哥哥！玩得开心吗～？\n这可是难得的百万公园哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ba76a28c64eeb4c17d54db61b2597e84fcd4a7dec87c67985c4038ea2ef0b9c2", "ja": "遊びで来てるわけじゃないけど、\nでも亜美のステージは、すごく楽しくてよかったぞ！", "zh": "我又不是来玩的，不过亚美的舞台特别有趣，能看到真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "45b9d1fce809c2678881e3c2d7953bcca529a81f20f0268cb796c04466bf3cbc", "ja": "そう？　そんじゃ、そんな兄ちゃんのテンションを、\nさらに爆アゲしちゃうネタをお教えしよう！", "zh": "是吗？那我就告诉你一个能让哥哥你情绪更加高涨的妙招！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "3750f942c846c5fd393a59053c05dcde208e81a37765f9b5fb0a427551a427b5", "ja": "……そこの兄ちゃんよ。\nミリオンパークの秘宝に興味はないかね？", "zh": "……那边那位小哥。\n你对百万乐园的秘宝感不感兴趣呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cf696916474be55ec7976245052b2a3cc27d389a5ff715d40b3724a9c2067deb", "ja": "ミリオンパークの秘宝……？", "zh": "百万公园的秘宝……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "24ae7a4d2787f2fc80f20358c4b751b35a89234c55d1913957e43f10086967d4", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　亜美のとっておきの\nネタなんだよ～！　気になるっしょ？", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪　这可是亚美珍藏的\n独家猛料哦～！　很想知道吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_1007", "source_sha256": "bf2fa05d7de57dea08fa1b559ebd51cc7c40316f95a64de2163bfd48f267cd5f", "ja": "気になる", "zh": "在意", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d7661ae76968159c905ffacb927af6264eaf1a7223ed045b5522b0c86a0b5f9b", "ja": "（まあ、気になるな。亜美のとっておきの\nネタだったら、詳しく聞いておきたいし）", "zh": "（嗯，确实有点在意。要是亚美珍藏的素材，我也想先详细听听）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_2001_p", "source_sha256": "f191bf311563aad89efb4a483a4de78f397a3549b258c6affe7161fe53af203b", "ja": "……場合によっては、俺が頭を下げに行くことに\nなるかもしれないしな……。", "zh": "……说不定还得我亲自去低头道歉呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_2002_011ami", "source_sha256": "39386c4ab44e6bc725dd12157aea75a82906342feb7c970e710933c2250b6c2c", "ja": "兄ちゃん？　なんか台詞と心の声が逆っぽくない？\nま、いいや。じゃーん！　ヒントはこれだよ！", "zh": "哥哥？台词和心里话好像反过来了吧？\n嘛，算啦。锵锵！提示就是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_2003_p", "source_sha256": "ccf13c9811171b6dfd1f90cb4271fd9a7032175543175667fedbc0ee2fdb2b56", "ja": "へえ、鉛筆でいろいろ書いてあるけど……\nこれは地図か？　ずいぶんボロボロの紙だな。", "zh": "咦，上面用铅笔写了不少东西，不过……\n这是地图吗？这张纸也太破旧了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_2004_011ami", "source_sha256": "fb3a45ab31c3401e4fa680d7a44359e016d3f6cbc85cf9bf4ac7ba434cecd2ad", "ja": "ボロボロなのは仕方ないっしょ？\n亜美達が小学生より前のだもん。", "zh": "破破烂烂的也没办法吧？\n这可是我们还没上小学前的东西呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_2005_011ami", "source_sha256": "dff940028e168e74de166b6530ef477f80034c93e77ad92cd17e4d9421c82e16", "ja": "ミリオンパークのどっかに絶対あるハズなんだけど、\n場所がイマイチわかんなくて……。", "zh": "米利翁公园里肯定有的，\n但具体在哪儿就不太清楚了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_2006_p", "source_sha256": "abed57a81298c6a1c4bade803cea178ff2f8ca6e208b51938284855ee4557a8b", "ja": "……なるほど。つまり真美と作った、\n秘宝の地図ってわけか。", "zh": "……原来如此。也就是说，这是你和真美一起做的\n藏宝图对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_2007_011ami", "source_sha256": "bd65e55205cc7eceaffb4358d6d086d0bf5a3fe8a71d1a15041a74e1dfde3ad9", "ja": "そう！　埋めるモノ選ぶのに、真美と一緒に\nめっちゃ悩んだのは覚えてるんだ～。", "zh": "没错！我还记得，为了挑选要埋的东西，和真美一起纠结了好久呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_2008_p", "source_sha256": "2875cc4f83b2023a86c9902a94bb221df81a26deb8df2fb10d3252129b8d0085", "ja": "はは、わかったよ。\n大事な秘宝、探しに行こうか。", "zh": "哈哈，知道了。我们去寻找珍贵的秘宝吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_2009_011ami", "source_sha256": "a9fc05625a472f5475fb058ccf3b8505e3c9620f32fa96d099d02a4e4ac40fba", "ja": "やったー！　さすが兄ちゃん！\n眠りし秘宝の鍵を開けるのは、今なのだ～！", "zh": "太好啦——！真不愧是哥！\n开启沉睡秘宝之锁的时刻，就是现在啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_2010_011ami", "source_sha256": "d444dd264ca94615be6a3726664005f76e95fdd3ef406566ef2deb2288122385", "ja": "兄ちゃん兄ちゃん！　ビンゴだよ！　あったよ！\nお宝発見だよ～！！　真美にも見せてあげなきゃ！", "zh": "哥哥哥哥！宾果！找到了！\n发现宝物啦～！！得给真美也看看才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0153_2011_p", "source_sha256": "eb76c08a4b910371a829b91d336168ebace4b1ac9ce049d1d45c20f0c8ec2111", "ja": "（見つかったのはどんぐり、ビー玉、おはじき……。\nうん、なかなかのお宝だったな！）", "zh": "（找到的是橡子、弹珠、玻璃珠……\n嗯，确实算得上是相当不错的宝物了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
